<title>USA: FREE-TO-TRADE - Illinois Health Fac. at 1400 EST.</title>
<headline>FREE-TO-TRADE - Illinois Health Fac. at 1400 EST.</headline>
<text>
<p>ILLINOIS HEALTH FACILITIES AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $165,620,000</p>
<p>REVENUE REFUNDING BONDS, SERIES 1997A</p>
<p>(ADVOCATE HEALTH CARE NETWORK)</p>
<p>Effective at 2:00 P.M. E.S.T., Monday, December 9, 1996 all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
